---
source: crates/keysmith-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
keysmith: the offline half of the air-gapped signer (derive, sign, decode). Contains no networking code.

Usage: keysmith <COMMAND>

Commands:
  mnemonic         Generate or validate BIP-39 mnemonics
  derive           Derive BIP-44 addresses (and optionally the account xpub) from a mnemonic
  address          Print the address of a key source
  keystore         Web3 Secret Storage v3 keystores (interoperable with `cast wallet`)
  sign             Sign an unsigned transaction envelope (keysmith/unsigned-tx@1)
  sign-auth        Sign an EIP-7702 authorization tuple
  sign-message     Sign a message with EIP-191 `personal_sign`
  verify-message   Verify an EIP-191 `personal_sign` signature
  sign-typed-data  Sign EIP-712 typed data (eth_signTypedData_v4 JSON)
  hash-typed-data  Print the EIP-712 encodeType, domain separator, struct hash and digest
  permit           Sign an ERC-2612 permit
  decode           Decode a raw signed transaction: type, signer, fees, intrinsic gas, findings
  help             Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
